   "attribution": null,
   "cause": "explicit_confirm only accepts yes/yep/yeah/confirmed when the message has at most 4 word tokens, so it returns None for the 7-token 'Yes, that's right, please go ahead.' reply. Under Arm F (consent_in_code=True), Driver.consent also discards any model 'yes', so Driver.book re-asks once via Driver.unclear and hands off to staff on the second attempt without booking."
  },
