   ],
   "attribution": "patient_voice",
   "cause": "For rambling patients, Voice._clear_yes emits \"Yes, that's right, please go ahead.\" (7 word tokens) and repeats it verbatim when re-asked, which exceeds explicit_confirm's 4-word limit. Because Arm F's Driver.consent ignores model \"yes\" answers, Driver.book treats both replies as unclear and Driver.unclear hands the session off to staff without booking."
  },
